> Converted from personal notes. Amounts are for one serving. Directions are editorial, not verified source instructions.

> REVIEW: Range 7/20 to 2/5: upper amount 2/5 selected for shopping.

== Ingredients ==

Gather the following ingredients: @salmon{2/5%lb} (range upper bound selected; original batch portion note omitted), @white rice{3/10%cup} (dry), @broccoli or bok choy{1/5%lb}, @gluten-free white miso{3/5%tbsp}, @brown sugar or honey{2/5%tbsp}, @gluten-free tamari{2/5%tbsp}, @rice vinegar{1/5%tbsp}, @sesame oil{1/5%tsp}, @olive oil{1/5%tbsp}, @green onions{2/5} (sliced), @sesame seeds{1/5%tsp}.

== Preparation ==

Cook rice and prepare the green vegetable separately. Mix miso, sugar or honey, tamari, vinegar and sesame oil. Brush over salmon and roast until cooked through, watching the glaze to prevent burning. Serve with rice, vegetables, green onion and sesame.
